<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">DZAK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Dzak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Dzak</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dzk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dzak</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nswɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu, ndyam olieel ndiri ndɛ li «Dzak, ɔ̃sal a Nziã ye wa Mfam Yeso Mãsia» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Abetsam ndiri ndɛ áli mvɔɔl a Yeso (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat 13.55</ref></char>), bvool ndiri ndɛ áli ye mboo yi ɔ̃bvɛn onse Ebvɔɔn li Yelusalem (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:9">Nga 2.9</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:13-21">Ɛ̃sa 15.13-21</ref></char>). Onse Ebvɔɔn olɔ, ndɛ áwi ɔ̃tsiin a ndɛ m'otee b'Ayuda. Okwɛn b'éli a ndɛ onse Bvɔɔn li akiool b'Ayuda, k'akoo k'ata bɔ enkyam wɛ. Bɔ osuo nzuru me nkel-nkel yi ékel ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu. Enkyam k'eli wɛ kwɛn ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan oli ɔ̃yuda, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ata Nzɔ a Nziã me «nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn Ayuda», ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn baal aluɛɛn kuul e Dzob, ki Abalayam ye ki Lahab, bvool k'ãmboo bibi ndɛ ayɛɛn m'ãndɔɔ m'áswɛn onse Ondoo b'otsɔɔn.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzak oswɛn ɔ̃nkaan ol'«ãyam ãnge-kuun ye mbuaal m'ãtsɔɔn m'ɔ̃kiri a nsie». Ãyam omɔ̃ ãyeel baal Ondoo b'otsɔɔn, mɔ̃ hɛ̃ ãli bvoo akiool bam bueel b'átsɔɔn me ndɔɔ a fool li áketuaal bɔ. Dzak onge wu áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu sua mvel wu ɛ̃kuũ-mpuɔ̃ (80) ye wu ɛ̃kuũ-mva (90), ke mbee epfu y'osiool o Yeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ɔ̃nkaan a Dzak, ãtsam ãbvɔɔn. Emfa ki éswɛn ndɛ ndɛ ekefɛɛn onge ɔ̃nkaan wu ãmboo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzak obɛɛn oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi etal ãyal. Ndɛ aliaal ndiri mɔ̃ ãfa ola Nziã, bvool ndiri ebvaan kwɛn baal asɔɔ mɔ̃ ola ndɛ y'okiool bueel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1.2-8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Dzak ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ apfel bwɛn aywal. Ndɛ bvool ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ ɛ̃mbio m'emfa bwɛn emfa y'onziã bo taa-taa b'omɔɔn m'ɛ̃sal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:9-27">1.9-27</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzak bvool apɛɛn bam kokɔ kwɛn baal abee k'asa ɔ̃bɛɛ onse Ebvɔɔn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Dzak ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi emwɛn baal onge yi nkiin onse ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ. Ndɔɔ oyɔ bvoo wɛn ebvaan akal mpɛɛ̃-a-mpɛɛ̃ okiool y'ɛ̃sal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2.14-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzak ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ebepaal elam e mbuul ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3.1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzak oyebvool k'oyɛɛn b'otal ãyal mã taa-taa ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:13-18">3.13-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Dzak ayiaan baal b'abeya y'obel onse Bvɔɔn, b'adzii ãndɔɔ m'ɔ̃kiri bvool abetsiil ãndɔɔ ã bakyɛ. Ndɛ bvool awa ãnkunkwa m'apfel b'abetwal bvel m'ɔ̃sal wu asal b'abesal ola bɔ ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:1-5:6">4.1–5.6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">K'osɛɛl b'ɔ̃kaan, Dzak atam kwɛn baal akal y'osɛ-mwiĩ, akal onse ãbuɛɛn, y'okuru b'ɔ̃kwal bvool awuaal a bakyɛ onse okiool ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5.7-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ki nguo k'eli kɛn okiool wɛ, ebvaan baal asa ãndɔɔ m'etam Endɔɔ e Nziã osa. Ebvaan okiool omɔɔn epfuũ bvi ngesɛ, ke ngwel wɛ «okiool oywɛn ɛ̃sal oli ɔ̃ku-kwa» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:26">2.26</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Dzak, ɔ̃sal a Nziã ye wa Mfam Yeso Mãsia, mɛ̃ mbio ãyam ãnge-kuun ye mbuaal m'ãtsɔɔn m'ɔ̃kiri a nsie.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃mbio bwɛn ãyal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, okɛɛn byɛ esam onse ɛ̃mbio mi emfa bwɛn emfa, ewal ndɔɔ oyɔ onge ndɔɔ yi esɛ bibi. <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn, okɛɛn okiool o byɛ obwel onse ɛ̃mbio, bɔ oburu osɛ-mwiĩ. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Kɛn ebvaan kwɛn osɛ-mwiĩ o byɛ oyi tiil ntɔ, kwɛn byɛ ekal amange-baal, ekal ɔ̃koo, bvool ekal baal bɛn eluɔ ki eywɛn bɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Okɛɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oywɛn a ãyal, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ asɔɔ mɔ̃ ola Nziã wu àwa ndɛ mɔ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã abewa baal bueel m'ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, mbyel pyɛ. M'emfa okyɛ ndɛ àwa ndɛ mɔ̃. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Kɛn a ndɛ ebvaan asɔɔ y'okiool, enkyam pyɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu asa enkyam oli onge epoo e nzal kyɛn mfel andɛɛl bvool afa a kyɛ ngwel abwel a kyɛ ngwel. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Mbuul wa m'emfa okyɛ, abee otsam wɛn ndɛ ol'obɔɔ eluɔ ola Mfam. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ oli mbuul wu ɛ̃kwal mviaal, bvool wɛn afa nkwel abvool mbee.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃ywal bwɛn ɔ̃pfel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Yɔɔl kwɛn ndoo wɛn obɔɔ pyɛ akal y'osia mpaa me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã andɛɛl ndɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Yɔɔl kwɛn ndoo wu oli ɔ̃pfel akal y'osia mpaa me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã akuaal ndɛ. Nzal-a-ŋɛn, ɔ̃pfel k'ayiil wɛ onge efel e bviĩ. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ebepal tal ye mwiĩ a mpuru wu akɛɛl bviĩ, efel e bvɛ ebetswal, oŋɔ̃ ompal o bvɛ ofi. Eli emfa kiki me ndɔɔ a ɔ̃pfel, ndɛ àdziɔɔn onse ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃mbio bwɛn efua bvi ebi-ebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Esɛ ola mbuul wu akuru ɔ̃kwal onse ɔ̃mbio! Ke ngwel wɛ, ke mbee a ŋ'esuo ndɛ osɛ-mwiĩ o ndɛ, ndɛ àbɔɔ ekɔrɔ ki okwɛn ki elaã, ki éwi Nziã b'adzii ndɛ lɔɔ. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Okɛɛn mbuul omwɛɛn y'ɔ̃mbio, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ abee oyɛɛn ndiri: «Nziã mbuul wu ombio mɛ̃.» Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã k'akoo k'abɔɔ efua ki asa obi wɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ k'atsɛɛn mbuul k'asa obi wɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Ŋ'esam mbuul onse ɔ̃mbio, eli efua e ndyam bvi ebi-ebi edzuru ndɛ bu ebal ndɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ŋ'eyi efua ki ebi-ebi onse mbuul, kyɛ eburu obi, bvool ŋ'ekwel obi onse ndɛ, bɔ oburu lepfu. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, ebee ãnzuru ã byam obepfuru: <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Kab lueel li ebvɛ-ebvɛ, li enduru obvie, ebefa ywel. Lɔ ebefa ola Nziã, wu ábuo ãmbaa ke ywel. Nziã k'abeswɛɛl emfa wɛ, ndɛ k'abekɔɔl empeel hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Ndɛ ndyam ádzii k'awa bia-byɛ elaã m'Endɔɔ e ndɛ li otaa-taa, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ ekal ke mboo yi nkwel onse eluɔ bvieel bvi ébuo ndɛ.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyoo y'osa o b'etam Endɔɔ e Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, mbuul ndyam wueel ebvaan akal ye nsuaal m'oyoo, y'olyam m'oyɛɛn, bvool m'oya o mpuru. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu oli onse mpuru k'asa ndɔɔ yi dzu ke mviil ã Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, embaal ãndɔɔ mbueel m' ãsuul byɛ onse mbiin ye mbueel m'ãbiil byɛ. Y'efyɛ lueel, eyɔɔ Endɔɔ li ákwɛn onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ, lɔ eli y'omfam b'obvuul byɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Esa b'etam Endɔɔ e Nziã, ebee osɛn kɛn a m'oyoo o lɔ. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, byɛ ãnzuru ã byam ebepfuru. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋɛn mbuul osɛn kɛn a m'oyoo b'Endɔɔ e Nziã, bvool k'asi b'etam lɔ wɛ, ndɛ oli onge mbuul wu otal osu o ndɛ b'emburu-ngoo onse etɛɛl. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Ke mbee a ŋ'etal ndɛ bɔ, ndɛ oyɛn tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, bvool odzɛɛn emfa ki eli ndɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Kɛn a mbuul wu asɔɔl ngel yi ɔ̃koo ngesɛ-ngesɛ, ngel yi esuul mbuul akal ndii, ndɛ akuru nzuru me yɔ, ndɛ k'asɛn kɛn a m'oyoo me ndɔɔ yi adzɛɛn wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ asa b'etam yɔ. Ndɛ ondɛ akal mbuul wu esɛ me mam mbueel m'esa ndɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Okɛɛn mbuul atsam ndiri ndɛ oli y'onziã, kwɛn ŋɛn ndɛ k'ayɛɛ k'akal y'omfam nkal elam e ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ nzuru a ndyam abepfuru: Onziã o ndɛ k'oli y'otsɛn wɛ. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Onziã bo taa-taa bvool b'oywɛn a mbiin ke mviil ã Nziã wu Taal, bɔ ba: Owuaal o baan b'ensiaan y'akaal b'apfiil onse fool e bɔ, bvool y'obee o k'akal onse mbiin a ɔ̃kiri.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Obee k'asa ɔ̃bɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, byɛ b'elɔ okiool o byɛ onse Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ wa lweel, ebee y'ɔ̃bɛɛ okal. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Emeeyoo ndɔɔ yi: Okɛɛn ɔ̃pfel ngɔmɔ̃ wu olaal endaa li ɔɔl y'ekɔ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ osam onse bvɔɔn e byɛ, okɛɛn ɔ̃ywal ngɔmɔ̃ hɛ̃ osam onse oŋɔ̃ m'ekɔ bvi ye mbiin, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />ŋɛn byɛ ewel mbuul wu olaal ekɔ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ ye dzuun bvool elieel ndɛ wɛn: «Y'abva nsɛn ŋã ke mboo yi dzuun yi», etɔ m'ɔ̃ywal, byɛ elieel ndɛ wɛn: «Yɛ, kal tɛ m'ɔ̃kiri oŋɔ̃», wuo byɛ elieel ndɛ wɛn: «Bva nsɛn me nsie ŋã ke ntaã e mɛ̃!» <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Byɛ oŋɔ̃ ke ŋ'esi ɔ̃bɛɛ onse byɛ wɛ? Byɛ oŋɔ̃ ke ŋ'eli antwel b'ãtsam ãbi-ãbi wɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, eyoo: Nziã ásueel baal bɛn ke mviil m'ɔ̃kiri, ali aywal, kwɛn bɔ akal apfel onse okiool bvool awal ɔ̃swal wu Okwɛn wu éwi ndɛ b'adzii ndɛ lɔɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ ebepfiɔɔl aywal! Kwɛn ŋɛn apfel baal b'abetuaal byɛ mpal bvool abebiri byɛ k'ãmbal, mfya? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />B'abefiɛɛn nkuũ yi mvɛ yi abetuaal ola byɛ, ke bɔ wɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Okɛɛn byɛ elweel ngel a Okwɛn onge b'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: «Yɛ adzii ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam», enkyam pyɛ, byɛ ŋ'esi ngesɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Kɛn a ŋɛn byɛ esa ɔ̃bɛɛ, byɛ ŋ'esa obi, bvool ngel ewa byɛ etumbu me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ŋ'efel yɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mbuul okieel ãngel m'ãsiil, kɛn a ndɛ ofel ngamɔ̃, ndɛ ŋ'afel ãngel mbueel. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wuwu wu álieel ndiri: «Oyɛɛ ke dzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul wɛ», wu álieel hɛ̃ ndiri: «Oyɛɛ ke bam mbuul wɛ.» M'emfa okyɛ, okɛɛn yɛ ke dzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul wɛ, kɛn a ŋɛn yɛ bam mbuul, yɛ ŋe fel ngel. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Eyɛɛn bvool esa ãndɔɔ onge baal bɛn akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ ã bɔ me ngel yi esuul mbuul ndii. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Ke yam, Nziã akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ nyiĩ pyɛ me mbuul wɛn k'asio bakyɛ nyiĩ wɛ. Kɛn a wu asio baal nyiĩ k'àkal ye ndɔɔ yi abal wɛ, ŋ'ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okiool bwɛn ɛ̃sal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, bvel emã li eyɛɛn mbuul ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ndi y'okiool», okɛɛn ndɛ k'asuo bɔ m'ɛ̃sal wɛ? Okiool b'obobɔ ol'okoo k'obvuul ndɛ? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Okɛɛn ndoo ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal wuo wu bɔɔl, oywɛn a ekɔ bvool oywɛn a bvi-odza bvi tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />kɛn a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yi onse opi, ywal mbal bvool dza yool!» Okɛɛn ndɛ k'awi ndɛ eluɔ ki nkiin me ndɔɔ a nzuru a ndɛ wɛ, oŋɔ̃ bvel emã? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Eli emfa kiki me ndɔɔ okiool: Bɔ okɛɛn oywɛn a ɛ̃sal, bɔ ŋ'omookwa li bam. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Kɛn a ŋɛn mbuul oyɛɛn ndiri: «Yɛ, yɛ li y'okiool, mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi y'ɛ̃sal.» Mɛ̃ èbveel ndɛ wɛn: «Mesuo mɛ̃ okiool o yɛ ŋɛn ɛ̃sal pyɛ! Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èsuo yɛ okiool o mɛ̃ m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ mɛ̃.» <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Yɛ abekiool wɛn Nziã oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃? Ngesɛ! Kɛn ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi hɛ̃ ɛ̃bekiool obobɔ bvool ɛ̃betiɔɔl. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Empwel e mbuul! Yɛ dzii k'ayɛɛ wɛn okiool bɛn ɛ̃sal pyɛ ngwel oli? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Nziã ŋ'ásiɔɔl Abalayam wu nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ onge mbuul wa dzu ale m'emã? Mpii me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áwi muaan m'Isak onge kab nkal a nkiin yi abewa Nziã ãkab. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Yɛ amwɛn, okiool y'ɛ̃sal mi Abalayam ɛ̃́keyi nkuul mɔ̃: Me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ, okiool o ndɛ otɔ ntɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />M'emfa okyɛ, asi m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: «Abalayam olɔ okiool onse Nziã, Nziã osiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Obɛ 15.6</ref></char></note>», bvool oti ndɛ me ndoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Byɛ oŋɔ̃ emwɛn, Nziã abewal mbuul onge wa dzu me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ, k'eli kɛn a me ndɔɔ okiool o ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Eli bubu me ndɔɔ a Lahab wu ɔ̃kaal nga-esio. Nziã ásiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu m'ãndɔɔ m'ési ndɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn ndɛ áyɔɔ antam b'áfi Isalayel bvool ásuul bɔ ayɛn me nkuul nkyam. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ke ngwel wɛ, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn nzuru eywɛn a ɔ̃fel eli nkwa-nkwa, emfa kiki okiool oywɛn a ɛ̃sal oli ɔ̃ku-kwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lelam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, ebee odzii kwɛn byɛ bueel ekal baal b'ayiool, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn bia-byɛ b'eyiool, akieel atsiil ãndɔɔ ã bia-byɛ ye kyal lueel. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Nzal-a-ŋɛn, bia-byɛ bueel ebetsɛɛl m'emfa bibi. Mbuul wɛn k'abetsɛɛl onse ãyɛɛn wɛ, ŋ'ali mbuul wu ɔ̃koo, wu okoo k'akal y'omfam hɛ̃ nkal a nzuru a ndɛ yueel. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Emeetal, okɛɛn bia-byɛ ebelɔ bvieel onse ɛ̃nywã mi aswebval kwɛn bɔ ayoo bia-byɛ, ŋɛn bia-byɛ ekoo hɛ̃ k'ekal y'omfam nkal nzuru a bɔ yueel. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Bvool emeetal ãsua, nkyam ŋɛn mɔ̃ ãli m'ãnɛn-m'ãnɛn bvool mfel wa kokɔ abetsɛɛn mɔ̃, abedzoo mɔ̃ m'eluɔ kyam ki etsi-tsiri, bvool mɔ̃ ãbeyi mboo yi edzii ɔ̃dzoo a mɔ̃. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Eli emfa kiki me lelam: Lɔ eli elyam ki etsi-tsiri onse nzuru a mbuul, kɛn a lɔ ebendɛɛl nzuru m'ãndɔɔ m'ãnɛn. Emeetal emfa kyɛn mbaa yi nsi-nsiri ekoo k'edziool edzwa ki enɛn! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Lelam hɛ̃ eli onge mbaa. Lɔ eli ɔ̃kiri ɔ̃tsiin wu ãbi. Lɔ ebebiil nzuru a mbuul yam yueel. Lɔ eli elyam e nzuru a bia-byɛ. Lɔ ebedziool omwiĩ bueel yi efi onse ywɛn e mbaa lam. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, anyam bueel b'edzwa, y'anywɛn, y'antaal y'answi, ali ke nsɛn okwɛn o mbuul, bvool ál'ali ke nsɛn okwɛn o ndɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Kɛn a lelam, mbuul wu okoo k'asuul lɔ ke nsɛn okwɛn o ndɛ k'ali wɛ. Lɔ eli eluɔ ki ebi-ebi kyɛn k'ebekal bam pi wɛ, bvool lɔ eluul tɔ m'ɔ̃twɔɔ wu abebam baal. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Me lɔ, bia-byɛ ebelweel ndɛ ondɛ wu oli Mfam bvool oli Tal a bia-byɛ. Me lɔ hɛ̃ bia-byɛ ebedza baal b'ébuo Nziã m'emfa e ndɛ mpaan. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />M'ɔ̃nywã wuwu, ãyɛɛn m'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl ye m'odza o mpaan ãbepal. Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, eyɔɔl kwɛn ebee obobɔ okal. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Ɔ̃tswɛ a mvieel ngɔmɔ̃ abepaal ãdza mã ngesɛ y'ãdza mã ye nkaa nkuul ngamɔ̃? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Andoo a mɛ̃ a dzii, ɔ̃ti wa fig okoo k'aburu nsia yi olibve? Ɔ̃ti wa bvine hɛ̃ okoo k'aburu nsia yi fig? Ɔ̃tswɛ a mvieel wɛn ãdza ãli y'ɔ̃ngwa k'akoo k'ani ãdza mã ngesɛ wɛ.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãyal m'ãfa ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Onse byɛ eli ye mbuul wu y'ɔ̃nyiã bvool y'ãyal? Yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ asuo mɔ̃ m'emfa ki ngesɛ ki ekal ndɛ, m'ãndɔɔ m'esa ndɛ onse efyɛ y'ɔ̃nyiã. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Kɛn okɛɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃luul me nsɔɔ yi enduru ɔ̃ndel, okɛɛn byɛ eli ye nzal-a-nsia, ebee ntwel obɛɛl. Ebee otaa-taa obiil me mfya a byɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Ãyal m'obobɔ ke m'ãfi ywel wɛ, mɔ̃ ãli m'ɔ̃kiri, m'ombuul bvool m'ɔ̃pfu. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mboo yi eli ɔ̃kwal nsɔɔ ye nzal-a-nsia, ku eli ɛ̃tsab y'ɛ̃sal mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi mi emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Kɛn ãyal m'ãfa ywel ãwa, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn, ɔ̃kwal wa tsɛtsɛ, ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɔ̃ ãwa opi y'efyɛ. Mɔ̃ ãdzii k'ãbvool baal, ãluul me nyiĩ bvool y'ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ. Mɔ̃ k'ãli y'ɔ̃bɛɛ wɛ, k'ãli hɛ̃ ye pfuru wɛ. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />B'abelɔ opi onse bɔ abekwɛn onse opi, bvool nsia yi ebɔɔ bɔ eli omwiĩ bo dzu.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Onkyab ke nkwel efua bvi ebi-ebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Obel onse byɛ, kwɛn ofi? Ãmvel onse byɛ, kwɛn ãfi? Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãbeya m'efua bvi ebedzwaan onse byɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Byɛ edzii eluɔ, kɛn a byɛ k'ebɔɔ kyɛ wɛ, byɛ eluul m'ɔ̃kwal-nsɔɔ bvool ebam. Kɛn a byɛ k'ekoo k'ebɔɔ ki edzii byɛ obɔɔ wɛ. Byɛ ebebel bvool ebedzwaan ãmvel, kɛn a byɛ k'ebebɔɔ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'ebesɔɔ ola Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Byɛ ebesɔɔ k'ebɔɔ wɛ, me yɛn byɛ ebesɔɔ obi-obi, nzal-a-ŋɛn byɛ edzii k'ebiil bvi ewa Nziã byɛ m'emfa ki etam efua e byam. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Byɛ eli onge ɔ̃kal wɛn k'akuru nzuru m'ɔ̃lam wɛ! Byɛ k'eyɛɛ wɛn wu odzii ɔ̃kiri wu obyel Nziã wɛ? Obobɔ, wu odzii k'akal ndoo a ɔ̃kiri, ŋ'ayii ɔ̃taal a Nziã. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Byɛ etsam wɛn eli ngwel k'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: «Nziã oli bam y'ebal me ndɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu élɔ ndɛ onse bia-byɛ?» <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Kɛn a nyiĩ yi ebewa Nziã bia-byɛ enduru okuun. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Ɔ̃nkaan olieel ndiri: «Nziã abekii ɛ̃yɛɛl ɛ̃ baal b'ali y'ondɛɛl o nzuru, kɛn a ndɛ abesio b'ali y'okuaal o nzuru nyiĩ.» <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Oŋɔ̃ elweel Nziã, esɛn ãnã ke nkwel ɔ̃pfu, obobɔ ndɛ abal lala ye byɛ. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Esyal tsotsoo a Nziã, obobɔ ndɛ àsyal tsotsoo a byɛ. Esuɔɔl mviɔɔl ɛ̃ byɛ, byɛ baal b'ãbi, bvool esuul ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ tsɛtsɛ, byɛ baal b'ɛ̃kwal mviaal! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Ekiool fool e byɛ, elaal mpiri, bvool elel! Yɔɔl kwɛn esyob e byɛ ekɔɔl elel, esɛ e byɛ hɛ̃ ekɔɔl ãwua. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Ekuaal ãnzuru ã byɛ ke nkwel a Mfam, obobɔ ndɛ àndɛɛl byɛ.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyɛɛ ke tsiil ãndɔɔ ã wumɔ̃ wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Andoo a dzii, ebee bakyɛ otuaal. Mbuul wu atuaal ndoo a ndɛ wuo wu atsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ, ŋ'atuaal ngel a Nziã bvool ŋ'atsiil ndɔɔ a yɔ. Okɛɛn yɛ atsiil ndɔɔ a ngel, yɛ ŋɛn ke bekal wu akiaal yɔ wɛ, ŋe yii ntwel a yɔ. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Ke yam, wu abewa ngel bvool oli ntwel, kɛn a Nziã ndyam, ndɛ wu okoo k'abvuul bvool okoo k'abam. Obobɔ, yɛ, yɛ nã li wu akal ntwel a ngaburu-mbuul?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebee y'ondɛɛl o nzuru okal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Meba ŋã, eyoo, byɛ b'ebeyɛɛn wɛn: «Nonɔ̃ wuo ɔ̃suu, bee èyi bviil li, bee èsa mvel ngɔmɔ̃, bee èta obɔɔ̃ bvool ebɔɔ nzi.» <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Byɛ k'eyɛɛ emfa ki èkal omwiĩ o byɛ ɔ̃suu wɛ. Ke yam, byɛ eli onge ebwii li epal me muaan-lio, ke mbee edzam. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Etal emfa kyɛn ebvaan byɛ eyɛɛn: «Ŋɛn Mfam odzii, bee èkal mwiĩ bvool èsa ndɔɔ yɛn a yɛn wuo yɛn a yɛn.» <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ke yam, byɛ eli y'ondɛɛl o nzuru bvool ye nzal-a-nsia. Ondɛɛl o nzuru bueel bo m'emfa okyɛ oli obi-obi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Ŋɛn mbuul oyɛɛ k'asa obvɛ bvool k'asi bɔ wɛ, ndɛ ŋ'asi obi.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Awi apfel ãnkunkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Meba ŋã, byɛ b'apfel, eyoo mɛ̃! Elel bvool eluɔɔl me ndɔɔ a fool li èyeyiool nkal a byɛ! <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Opfel o byɛ obwel, bvool ekɔ e byɛ asieel adzi. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Ɔɔl ye nzi e byɛ eburu nkoo, bvool nkoo oyɔ èfɛn byɛ, yɔ èdza ãnzuru ã byɛ onge mbaa. Byɛ ál'ebvool opfel m'ãtsoo mã ntɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Byɛ ebee k'ewa furu li asal b'asal onse ãnguun ã byɛ. Furu olɔ ebeta ɛ̃baan. Ɛ̃nduɔɔl mi asal obɔ ɛ̃tɔ tiil m'ãtswi ã Mfam Sabahote. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Byɛ ekal me nsie onse opfel y'efua. Byɛ eyii tiaal-tiaal onge anyam b'akiaal tsoo li atiɛɛn bɔ ãbwel. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Byɛ ewi etumbu bvool ebam mbuul wa dzu. Ndɛ oyɔɔl byɛ esi b'edzii byɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osɛ-mwiĩ y'ebuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Andoo, oŋɔ̃ ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ tiil k'eya Mfam. Emeetal ɔ̃sal a ãnguun: Ndɛ oli y'osɛ-mwiĩ bibi b'akiaal ekwɛn e nsie bvi ngesɛ, bɛɛn bvi ɛ̃kwel tiil bvi ãmbee. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Byɛ hɛ̃ ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ! Ekal ye mpɛn, ke ngwel wɛ oya o Mfam oyii tsotsoo. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Andoo a mɛ̃, ebee obeluɔɔl onse byam-a-byam, kwɛn Nziã abee byɛ etumbu owa. Etal, wu atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal otɛɛn ke kwel edzoo. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Andoo, me ndɔɔ yi etal fool y'osɛ-mwiĩ, eluɛɛn kuul li aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã b'áyɛɛn me nkuũ a Mfam. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Etal! Bia-byɛ ebetuɛɛn baal b'ákuru mwiĩ onse fool. Byɛ eyoo ɔ̃sam wu osɛ-mwiĩ o Dzob, bvool byɛ emwɛn ki éwi Mfam ndɛ ke ntɔ, ke ngwel wɛ Mfam oluul me dzii ye nyiĩ. <verse eid="JAS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Andoo, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, ebee ɛ̃sob obedza, ekal me nkuũ a ywel, ekal me nkuũ a nsie, wuo ebee ɔ̃sob ndyam ɔ̃bi pyɛ odza. Eyɛɛn kɛn a wɛn «hɛɛ̃» okɛɛn eli hɛɛ̃, bvool wɛn «hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃» okɛɛn eli hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ebee onse etumbu e Nziã obva.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oli onse fool? Yɔɔl ndɛ abuɛɛn. Ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oli onse esɛ? Yɔɔl ndɛ ayam ãnziĩ. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oli y'ãluu? Yɔɔl ndɛ ata akuul-kuul b'Ebvɔɔn mbel, kwɛn bɔ abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, bvool asɛɛn ndɛ mbaal me nkuũ a Mfam. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Ebuɛɛn li y'okiool èbvuul nga-ãluu bvool Mfam àtɛɛl ndɛ. Okɛɛn ndɛ asi ãbi, àdzeel ndɛ mɔ̃. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Oŋɔ̃ esɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi onse byam-a-byam, bvool ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bakyɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ byɛ ebvuul. Ebuɛɛn li mbuul wa dzu esal ye mpɛn ngamfɛn. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eli wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã áli mbuul wu emfa emɔ̃ ye bia-byɛ: Ndɛ ábuɛɛn y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ kwɛn mvel abee ondwɔɔ, bvool mvel k'andwɔɔ me nsie wɛ tiil mvel tyel y'etswel. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Ndɛ bvool ábuɛɛn, obobɔ ywel ewi mvel bvool nsie eburu ekwɛn e yɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Andoo a mɛ̃, okɛɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ amaadziɔɔn lala y'otaa-taa, ŋɛn wukyɛ oyebveel ndɛ, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />eyɛɛ wɛn mbuul wu abiri nga-ãbi me nkuul yi edziɔɔn ndɛ me yɔ, ŋ'abvuul ndɛ onse lepfu bvool osi kwɛn adzeel ɔ̃bobɔ wu ãbi ã ndɛ.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>